<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 116 0 R
/T (The mission has not changed. CMU-Africa exists to build a transformative future for the continent, and research remains one of the sharpest instruments we have to do that. What has changed, and you'll see it on the pages that follow, is the scale and reach of what our students are actually accomplishing. This past summer alone, Tartans represented the university across Africa, Europe, Asia, and Australia, published in international venues, and released open tools already being used by communities the wider AI world has overlooked. Read those pages closely. In a year or two, they'll be about you.)
/E (The mission has not changed. CMU-Africa exists to build a transformative future for the continent, and research remains one of the sharpest instruments we have to do that. What has changed, and you'll see it on the pages that follow, is the scale and reach of what our students are actually accomplishing. This past summer alone, Tartans represented the university across Africa, Europe, Asia, and Australia, published in international venues, and released open tools already being used by communities the wider AI world has overlooked. Read those pages closely. In a year or two, they'll be about you.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
