/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 116 0 R
/T (Research is a demanding pursuit - we won't pretend otherwise. It asks for late nights, a tolerance for being wrong in public, and the patience to sit with problems that don't yield on the first try. But the skills, the collaborators, and the solutions you develop here will follow you long after your time in Kigali, and the questions you choose to work on will help shape the continent for years to come.)
/E (Research is a demanding pursuit - we won't pretend otherwise. It asks for late nights, a tolerance for being wrong in public, and the patience to sit with problems that don't yield on the first try. But the skills, the collaborators, and the solutions you develop here will follow you long after your time in Kigali, and the questions you choose to work on will help shape the continent for years to come.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
