/T (Research is a systematic and purposeful process of investigating a clearly defined question in order to generate new knowledge or deeper understanding. It goes beyond simply gathering information; it requires critical thinking, careful planning, and the use of appropriate methods to test ideas or hypotheses in a structured and reproducible way. In fields such as Engineering, research often involves identifying a gap or limitation in existing work, proposing a meaningful improvement or new approach, and evaluating it through well-designed experiments and thoughtful analysis.)
/E (Research is a systematic and purposeful process of investigating a clearly defined question in order to generate new knowledge or deeper understanding. It goes beyond simply gathering information; it requires critical thinking, careful planning, and the use of appropriate methods to test ideas or hypotheses in a structured and reproducible way. In fields such as Engineering, research often involves identifying a gap or limitation in existing work, proposing a meaningful improvement or new approach, and evaluating it through well-designed experiments and thoughtful analysis.)
