/T (At CMU-Africa, the summer between first and second year is when many students take their most ambitious step outside the classroom. Some pursue industry internships - a requirement for MSIT students and a strong option for MSEAI and MSECE - while others use the time to go deeper into research: joining faculty projects, publishing papers, presenting at international conferences, or attending competitive summer schools abroad.)
