318 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 123 0 R
/T (Some of the most important documents in the world can't leave the building they live in. At the IMF, Glorry spent his summer working on exactly that constraint: adapting a small open-weight vision-language model - around 3B parameters - to extract structured information from multilingual administrative documents, in a setting where the real corpus was confidential and could never be used for training.)
/E (Some of the most important documents in the world can't leave the building they live in. At the IMF, Glorry spent his summer working on exactly that constraint: adapting a small open-weight vision-language model - around 3B parameters - to extract structured information from multilingual administrative documents, in a setting where the real corpus was confidential and could never be used for training.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
319 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 123 0 R
/T (His workaround was to build a synthetic document generator calibrated on aggregate statistics from the real corpus - reproducing realistic layouts, scan and photo artifacts, stamps, and multi-page structures across nine languages. He then fine-tuned the model using parameter-efficient methods \(QLoRA\) on on-premise GPU hardware, and designed the evaluation around leakage-safe held-out splits, per-field accuracy, and significance testing against a zero-shot baseline. The result: the fine-tuned model reached strong extraction accuracy on document categories where the base model had scored zero. Agentic AI tooling ran throughout his daily engineering workflow, giving his practical grounding in the second half of his research area.)
/E (His workaround was to build a synthetic document generator calibrated on aggregate statistics from the real corpus - reproducing realistic layouts, scan and photo artifacts, stamps, and multi-page structures across nine languages. He then fine-tuned the model using parameter-efficient methods \(QLoRA\) on on-premise GPU hardware, and designed the evaluation around leakage-safe held-out splits, per-field accuracy, and significance testing against a zero-shot baseline. The result: the fine-tuned model reached strong extraction accuracy on document categories where the base model had scored zero. Agentic AI tooling ran throughout his daily engineering workflow, giving his practical grounding in the second half of his research area.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
320 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 123 0 R
/T <>
/E <>
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
321 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 123 0 R
/T (He also got hands-on with the full low-resource fine-tuning stack: quantized training, token budgets, multi-image inputs, and the unglamorous work that takes most of the time - data provenance, reproducible seeds, and keeping multi-day jobs alive on remote machines. "Above all, I learned that working with confidential data is mostly about designing pipelines where the data never needs to move.")
/E (He also got hands-on with the full low-resource fine-tuning stack: quantized training, token budgets, multi-image inputs, and the unglamorous work that takes most of the time - data provenance, reproducible seeds, and keeping multi-day jobs alive on remote machines. "Above all, I learned that working with confidential data is mostly about designing pipelines where the data never needs to move.")
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
