461 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 129 0 R
/T (Africa's second-life battery economy - reusing spent electric-vehicle battery packs to power microgrids - is one of the more promising paths toward affordable off-grid electricity. But the international standards governing this space overwhelmingly regulate end-product performance, not the technicians who dismantle the packs to begin with. Kayesu's paper closes that gap.)
/E (Africa's second-life battery economy - reusing spent electric-vehicle battery packs to power microgrids - is one of the more promising paths toward affordable off-grid electricity. But the international standards governing this space overwhelmingly regulate end-product performance, not the technicians who dismantle the packs to begin with. Kayesu's paper closes that gap.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
