463 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 129 0 R
/T (Energy-access research is often about the technology; this paper is about the people who touch the technology. Both have to work - and the human side is the one more often overlooked. That Kayesu chose to build the safety infrastructure alongside the engineering one is exactly the kind of decision that turns a promising sector into a responsible one.)
/E (Energy-access research is often about the technology; this paper is about the people who touch the technology. Both have to work - and the human side is the one more often overlooked. That Kayesu chose to build the safety infrastructure alongside the engineering one is exactly the kind of decision that turns a promising sector into a responsible one.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [10]
>>
