/Title (Energy-access research is often about the technology; this paper is about the people who touch the technology. Both have to work - and the human side is the one more often overlooked. That Kayesu chose to build the safety infrastructure alongside the engineering one is exactly the kind of decision that turns a promising sector into a responsible one.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1707 0 R
/Next 1745 0 R
>>
