1769 0 obj
<<
/Title (Making frontier models runnable in the places that most need them - hospitals, classrooms, and phones without a datacenter behind them - is one of the field's quietest but most consequential problems. Compression that respects what a model actually learned is how deployment becomes possible, and how the benefits of these systems reach beyond the labs that trained them.)
/Dest [23 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1739 0 R
/Next 1770 0 R
>>
