/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1828 0 R
/Prev 1840 0 R
>>
endobj
1839 0 obj
<<
/Title <>
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1830 0 R
>>
endobj
1840 0 obj
<<
/Title (He also got hands-on with the full low-resource fine-tuning stack: quantized training, token budgets, multi-image inputs, and the unglamorous work that takes most of the time - data provenance, reproducible seeds, and keeping multi-day jobs alive on remote machines. "Above all, I learned that working with confidential data is mostly about designing pipelines where the data never needs to move.")
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1828 0 R
/Prev 1837 0 R
/Next 1838 0 R
>>
endobj
